  a sign or tag on screen in the first second.
- Line 2 starts "You see," and explains the rule in one breath.
- Life under the rule in concrete pictures: real places, real jobs, what people do. The town LOVES
  the rule. One line of history from a grandparent.
- Plant exactly three small lines early and mark them [P1] [P2] [P3]:
  P1 a rule the kid must repeat, P2 an odd thing only the kid has noticed, P3 a grandparent's saying.
- "Then one day..." something arrives that makes the rule cruel. The town cheers. Only the kid sees
