  each shot it sets up actors, fires a "Cue" RemoteEvent with the shot number, and prints
  "SHOT <n> <start> <end>". At the end it prints "DONE".
  It runs all animation through each Humanoid's Animator (default R15: idle 507766388, walk
  507777826, run 507767714, wave 507770239, point 507770453, cheer 507770677, laugh 507770818), all
